# The benchmark corpus is real data - see nix/tests/corpus.nix - and every file
# is 737 MiB. Plain git blobs of that size are refused by most forges (GitHub
# caps a blob at 100 MB), so they go through LFS: the repository holds a pointer
# and the forges hold the bytes.
nix/tests/data/*.bin filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
